@startuml companion-container-stack
!pragma layout smetana
!theme plain
title Testing Companion — Containerised Local Stack (docker-compose)

skinparam rectangle {
  FontSize 11
  BorderColor #888888
}
skinparam component {
  FontSize 10
  BorderColor #888888
}

rectangle "**docker-compose stack**\n(runs locally with a single command)" as STACK {

  rectangle "**Data Layer**" as DATA #FFF9C4 {
    component "HAPI FHIR Server\n(R4)\nHosts loaded IG packages\nand test resources" as HAPI #FFFDE7
  }

  rectangle "**Interaction Layer**" as INTERACT #E8F5E9 {
    component "SDC Form Renderer\n(e.g. LHC-Forms / NLM)\nRenders Questionnaires,\nruns population + extraction" as RENDERER #DDFBE8
    component "Test Data Seeder\n(shell script / Python)\nLoads Companion IG examples\ninto FHIR server on startup" as SEEDER #DDFBE8
  }

  rectangle "**Validation Layer**" as VALID #E3F2FD {
    component "IG Validator\n(publisher.jar -validate)\nValidates extracted resources\nagainst main IG profiles" as VALIDATOR #DDEEFF
  }

  rectangle "**Tooling**" as TOOLS #FCE4EC {
    component "Demo scripts\n(bash / Python)\nReplay end-to-end scenarios\nagainst local stack" as SCRIPTS #FFEBEE
  }
}

SEEDER --> HAPI : seed test data\non startup
RENDERER --> HAPI : FHIR REST\n(read/write)
VALIDATOR --> HAPI : fetch resources\nfor validation
SCRIPTS --> HAPI : drive scenarios\nvia FHIR API
SCRIPTS --> RENDERER : open forms\nfor walkthrough

note bottom of STACK
  Start with:
  docker-compose up
  Browse to http://localhost:8080
end note

@enduml
